{
    "title": "Nuts Sort Master",
    "description": "Nuts Sort Master is a fun and addictive game! A challenging yet relaxing game to exercise your brain! Every time the colored nuts are sorted and stacked nuts by color onto the corresponding screws, the sense of relaxation it brings will relieve stress and keep you away from daily worries.  \u2728\u2728HOW TO PLAY\u2728\u2728 \r\n\ud83d\udd29 Tap a bolt to pick up the top nut, then tap another screw to move it. \r\n\ud83d\udd29 Nuts can only be placed on top of another nuts when the two nuts are the same color and the screw has enough space. \r\n\ud83d\udd29 The rule is to put all the nuts of the same color in one screw to complete the level. \r\n\ud83d\udd29 Use \"undo\" to go back to the previous steps.\r\n\ud83d\udd29 If you don't know what to do next step, you can use the \"Hint\".\r\n\ud83d\udd29 If you get stuck, you can add an extra screw. \r\n\ud83d\udd29 You can restart the level at any time.\r\n\u2728\u2728 FEATURES \u2728\u2728\r\n\ud83e\udd29 One finger control.\r\n\ud83c\udd93 FREE & EASY TO PLAY.\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Thousands of levels to challenge.\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain with relaxing games .\r\n\u2615 No penalty! NO time limit! \r\n\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69\ud83d\udc67\ud83d\udc66 Family game, suitable for all ages.\r\nYou can enjoy this game at your own pace!Download Nuts Sort Master and enjoy the game, challenge yourself, and experience the thrill and relaxation of switching freely! Play with your family and friends! See who will become the master of nut sorting!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Nuts Sort Master is a fun and addictive game! A challenging yet relaxing game to exercise your brain! Every time the colored nuts are sorted and stacked nuts by color onto the corresponding screws, the sense of relaxation it brings will relieve stress and keep you away from daily worries.  \u2728\u2728HOW TO PLAY\u2728\u2728 <br>\ud83d\udd29 Tap a bolt to pick up the top nut, then tap another screw to move it. <br>\ud83d\udd29 Nuts can only be placed on top of another nuts when the two nuts are the same color and the screw has enough space. <br>\ud83d\udd29 The rule is to put all the nuts of the same color in one screw to complete the level. <br>\ud83d\udd29 Use &quot;undo&quot; to go back to the previous steps.<br>\ud83d\udd29 If you don&#39;t know what to do next step, you can use the &quot;Hint&quot;.<br>\ud83d\udd29 If you get stuck, you can add an extra screw. <br>\ud83d\udd29 You can restart the level at any time.<br>\u2728\u2728 FEATURES \u2728\u2728<br>\ud83e\udd29 One finger control.<br>\ud83c\udd93 FREE &amp; EASY TO PLAY.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Thousands of levels to challenge.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain with relaxing games .<br>\u2615 No penalty! NO time limit! <br>\ud83d\udc68\ud83d\udc69\ud83d\udc67\ud83d\udc66 Family game, suitable for all ages.<br>You can enjoy this game at your own pace!Download Nuts Sort Master and enjoy the game, challenge yourself, and experience the thrill and relaxation of switching freely! Play with your family and friends! See who will become the master of nut sorting!",
    "summary": "Nuts Sort Master\uff1a A challenging but addictive color sorting game!",
